Template: agenticsdr/baseurl
Type: string
Default: https://api.openai.com/v1
Description: OpenAI-compatible endpoint:
 The page talks to a server that implements the OpenAI chat protocol.
 Use https://api.openai.com/v1, or a local server such as
 http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1.

Template: agenticsdr/model
Type: string
Default: gpt-4o-mini
Description: Model name:
 The name that endpoint expects, such as gpt-4o-mini or llama3.2.

Template: agenticsdr/apikey
Type: password
Description: API key:
 Leave this empty for a local server that does not use a key. The key is
 stored in /etc/agenticsdr/llm.json, readable only by root, and is sent
 only to the endpoint above.
